<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Banco Santander started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Banco Santander started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- J.P. Morgan Securities said it initiated coverage of Banco Santander SA with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- &quot;Banco Santander has transformed itself since 1990 from a medium-sized and domestically oriented retail bank into a global player,&quot; a J.P. Morgan report said.</p>
<p>-- The bank's ADRS were off 3/4 at 60.  </p>
<p>--</p>
</text>
